  "definition": "Permanently Disabled Veterans License",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-02-23",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fis 1100) #8183, eff 9-28-04 (formerly Fis 1208.07); ss by #9800-B, eff 1-1-11; ss by #12785, eff 5-22-19; ss by #13874, eff 2-23-24",
